<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine says World Bank approves $125 mln loan.</title>
<headline>Argentine says World Bank approves $125 mln loan.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The World Bank has approved a $125 million for agricultural development in Argentina, the Agriculture Secretariat said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The loan was arpproved by the World Bank this week, will be repaid over 15 years and has a five-year grace period. It will carry an annual interest rate of between six and seven percent, the Secretariat said.</p>
<p>The funds will be disbursed around the middle of this year.</p>
<p>((Jason Webb, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
